## Relationship Diagram (Mental Model)

```
dim_company   dim_industry   dim_date
      \            |            /
       \           |           /
        ---- fact_company_risk ----
                   |
              dim_officer
```

`fact_company_risk` is the central scoring fact — the platform's primary deliverable. The four
dimensions provide the descriptive axes (who, when, what sector, governance summary) used to
slice and compare risk.
